# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore before the root
# .dockerignore). Allow-list: only what the build stages copy.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!web/
crates/**/target
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/dist-*
web/test-results
web/e2e/artifacts
web/**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
